@startuml
title /predict 接口调用时序

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器\n(JS Fetch)" as Browser
participant "Flask Router\napp/app.py" as Flask
participant "Model Inference\n(TensorFlow)" as Model
participant "Rule Advice\nEngine" as RuleEngine
database "uploads/" as Upload

User -> Browser: 选择面/舌图片\n点击「开始分析」
activate Browser

Browser -> Flask: POST /predict\nFormData(face, tongue)
activate Flask

Flask -> Upload: save face.jpg, tongue.jpg
activate Upload
Upload --> Flask: saved paths
deactivate Upload

Flask -> Model: preprocess_image(face_path)\npreprocess_image(tongue_path)
activate Model
note right of Model
  Resize 224×224
  归一化 [0,1]
  扩维 (1,224,224,3)
end note
Model --> Flask: face_arr, tongue_arr

Flask -> Model: model.predict((face_arr, tongue_arr))
Model --> Flask: Softmax probabilities [p1, p2, p3]
deactivate Model

Flask -> Flask: argmax → label\nCLASS_NAMES[idx]

Flask -> RuleEngine: get_rule_advice(label)
activate RuleEngine
RuleEngine --> Flask: {饮食调理, 作息建议, 运动指导, 中医调理, 心理调节}
deactivate RuleEngine

Flask -> Flask: 组装 JSON\n{success, label, probabilities, advice:{rule}}

Flask --> Browser: HTTP 200 JSON Response
deactivate Flask

Browser -> Browser: 渲染结果标签\n概率柱状图动画\n标准建议卡片

Browser --> User: 展示分析结果
deactivate Browser

@enduml
